.TH VOLBAR 1 "2026" "Volbar @@VERSION@@" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
volbar \- simple X11 volume bar. Tiny footprint, highly customizable.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B volbar
[\fIOPTIONS\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Volbar is a lightweight volume bar popup for X11 desktops. It displays volume changes with customizable themes, sizes, positions, and slider styles.
.SH OPTIONS
.SS Display Options
.TP
.BR \-\-size " \fISIZE\fR"
Window size: small, medium, large (default: medium)
.TP
.BR \-\-placement " \fIPOS\fR"
Position: center, top, bottom, left, right, top-left, top-right, bottom-left, bottom-right (default: center)
.TP
.BR \-\-icon " on|off"
Show volume icon (default: on)
.TP
.BR \-\-percent " on|off"
Show percentage (default: on)
.TP
.BR \-\-slider " \fITYPE\fR"
Slider style: smooth, blocks, dots, line (default: smooth)
.TP
.BR \-\-theme " \fINAME\fR"
Theme name from ~/.config/volbar/themes/, or one of the wallpaper-color themes: 'auto' (tries pywal, then Mabox conky), 'wal' (force pywal), 'mabox' (force Mabox conky) (default: default)
.TP
.BR \-\-timeout " \fIMS\fR"
Display timeout in milliseconds (default: 2000)
.SS Daemon Options
.TP
.BR \-\-start\-daemon
Start background monitoring daemon
.TP
.BR \-\-stop\-daemon
Stop running daemon
.TP
.BR \-\-poll\-interval " \fIMS\fR"
Volume check interval for daemon in milliseconds (default: 200)
.SS System Tray Options
.TP
.BR \-\-systray\-icon
Enable system tray volume control (X11 only)
.TP
.BR \-\-tray\-step " \fIN\fR"
Volume step per scroll (default: 5)
.TP
.BR \-\-mixer " \fICMD\fR"
Mixer command for tray menu (default: pavucontrol)
.SS Other Options
.TP
.BR \-\-debug
Enable debug output
.TP
.BR \-\-list\-themes
List available themes
.TP
.BR \-\-list\-sliders
List available slider styles
.TP
.BR \-\-test\-themes
Preview all themes
.TP
.BR \-\-show
Show volume once and exit (default mode)
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Display help message
.TP
.BR \-v ", " \-\-version
Display version information
.SH SLIDER STYLES
.TP
.B smooth
Continuous filled bar, styled via CSS (default)
.TP
.B blocks
█████░░░░░
.TP
.B dots
●●●●●○○○○○
.TP
.B line
━━━━━─────
.SH THEMES
Themes are CSS files in ~/.config/volbar/themes/ or /usr/local/share/volbar/themes/.
.PP
Three special theme names generate a CSS theme from wallpaper-derived colors instead of reading a file:
.TP
.B auto
Tries pywal (~/.cache/wal/colors.json) first, then Mabox conky (~/.config/conky/sysinfo_mbcolor.conkyrc), falling back to the default theme if neither is found.
.TP
.B wal
Forces pywal colors only; falls back to the default theme (with a warning) if colors.json is missing.
.TP
.B mabox
Forces Mabox conky colors only; falls back to the default theme (with a warning) if the conky file is missing.
.PP
\fBTip:\fR pywal's colors.json is a cache, and volbar only reads it \- it never regenerates it. Changing your wallpaper does not update
.B wal
or
.B auto
theming by itself. Re-run
.B wal \-i /path/to/wallpaper
manually after each change, or wire it into your wallpaper-change script/hook. We deliberately avoid an automatic hook in volbar itself, since that would also re-theme on every slideshow rotation. The same caveat applies to
.B mabox
if Mabox's own wall2themes auto-theming is disabled.
.PP
Example custom theme:
.PP
.RS
.nf
#volbar-container {
    background-color: #1a1a1a;
    border: 2px solid #00ff00;
}

label#icon { color: #00ff00; }
label#slider { color: #00ff00; }
label#percentage { color: #ffffff; }

levelbar#slider trough { background-color: alpha(#00ff00, 0.25); }
levelbar#slider block.filled { background-color: #00ff00; }

label#icon.muted,
label#slider.muted,
label#percentage.muted { color: #ff0000; }
levelbar#slider.muted block.filled { background-color: #ff0000; }
.fi
.RE
.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
.B volbar \-\-show
Show volume bar once
.TP
.B volbar \-\-show \-\-theme auto
Use wallpaper colors (pywal, then Mabox conky)
.TP
.B volbar \-\-show \-\-theme wal
Force pywal colors
.TP
.B volbar \-\-show \-\-theme mabox
Force Mabox conky colors
.TP
.B volbar \-\-show \-\-slider line \-\-placement top
Line slider at top
.TP
.B volbar \-\-start\-daemon \-\-theme auto
Daemon with wallpaper colors
.TP
.B volbar \-\-start\-daemon \-\-systray\-icon
Daemon with tray icon
.TP
.B volbar \-\-stop\-daemon
Stop daemon
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/volbar/themes/
User themes
.TP
.I /usr/local/share/volbar/themes/
System themes
.TP
.I ~/.cache/wal/colors.json
Pywal wallpaper colors (for auto/wal themes)
.TP
.I ~/.config/conky/sysinfo_mbcolor.conkyrc
Mabox conky wallpaper colors (for auto/mabox themes)
.TP
.I ~/.cache/volbar.pid
Daemon PID file
.SH AUDIO BACKENDS
Auto-detected in order: PipeWire (wpctl), PulseAudio (pactl), ALSA (amixer).
.SH SYSTEM TRAY
.IP \(bu 2
Scroll: adjust volume
.IP \(bu 2
Left/middle-click: toggle mute
.IP \(bu 2
Right-click: menu
